Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:09.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么  我重新整理过冰箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? I reorganized the fridge, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  最底下  放肉跟奶制品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? Uh, bottom shelf, meats and dairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中间  放水果蔬菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Middle shelf, fruits and vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最上面  放过期食物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And top shelf, expired products.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你吃饱撑着啊  因为我无聊到快抓狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are you doing this? Because I am bored out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经去过银行  邮局  干洗店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've already been to the bank, post office and dry cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你做完我一周的工作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, you just described seven days worth of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要把工作分散一点  难道你从来没失业过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gotta spread it out a little, you know. Haven't you ever been unemployed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是失业  只是进修中（有安息之意）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not unemployed. I'm on sabbatical.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.33,0:00:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少跟我传教  拜托\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, don't get religious on me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该练习放轻松\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A guy in your position needs to be a little better at relaxing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们家怎么会有安乐椅啊  过来  坐下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you think we have the comfortable chairs, huh? Here, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好没  仔细看了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready? Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.22,0:00:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.47,0:00:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}AW, yeah! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.06,0:01:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  光坐着  当然不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what? We just sit? Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是坐着  看好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not gonna just sit. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈喽  我是钱德宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello. Chandler Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈喽  宾先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Mr. Bing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  不管你是谁  别再打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, whoever this is, stop calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经骚扰我半年了  一点也不好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been six months! It's not funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.29,0:01:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:28.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你  行行好  别再骚扰我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Leave me alone! For the love of God, leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.71,0:01:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这只是周三的乐子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's Wednesday. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:34.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第10集  情比兄妹深\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E10  The One With The Inappropriate Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:02:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  告诉你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys. Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.35,0:02:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,英国人要打来啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The British are coming'
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.52,0:02:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的笑话真冷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you and your ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶诞节快到了  我要负责去募捐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since it's Christmas, I'm gonna be one of those people collecting donations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经拿到铃铛  过几天就能拿到募捐筒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I already have my bell, and later on I get my bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我要散播欢乐给大家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. I'll be spreading joy to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去年散播的不够多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Last year I spread a little joy, but not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:52.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以今年  一定要让全纽约都感受到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this year, I'm gonna do the whole city. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个高中同学也跟你一样  她很红\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I knew a girl in high school who did that. She was very popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:03:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你要去哪里摇铃呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, so, Pheebs, where are you doing your bell ringing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我分到梅西百货旁当红的位子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They gave me a great spot right by Macy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新人很少能分到这个位子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They never give such a good corner to a rookie...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.47,0:03:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是只有我会用25种语言  说圣诞快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I'm the only one who can say "Merry Christmas" in 25 languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我胡编的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  丹尼在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Okay, you guys, here's Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看见没  还假装对我没兴趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? Still pretending he's not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.91,0:03:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他走过来了  大家装作不认识  忘记他是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, he's coming over. Pretend we've forgotten who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:33.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好  丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hey, Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Danny! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.51,0:03:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  你认得瑞秋吧  她人很好  长得也不赖  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Danny, you know Rachel. She's nice. She's not bad to look at, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.18,0:03:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  摩妮卡  当然啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, Mon. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要跟她约会  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you wanna go out on a date with her? Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  周五可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely. ls Friday okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我的天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.73,0:03:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周五太好了  她都等不及要赴约了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friday is perfect. She can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.57,0:04:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约会时  我可以直接跟她说话吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On the date, I will be able to talk to her directly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周五见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See you Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你搞什么啊  算了  不用说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, what the hell was that? You know what? Don't answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟丹尼约会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have a date with Danny. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:16.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会落选\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could I not get the part?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主角就是出身皇后区的  29岁意大利演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The play was about a 29-year-old Italian actor from Queens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.34,0:04:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是  泰莉雅雪儿突然有空\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Talia Shire suddenly became available.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是欧巴桑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我说什么  人家就是有办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What can I say? She nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  还有什么戏份\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, okay. ls there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定又会拒绝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you're just gonna say no again, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.81,0:04:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同性恋A片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}---gay porn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佳节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Happy holidays!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圣诞快乐（西班牙文）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}[Speak in Spanish]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  圣诞快乐（法文）\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  祝你幸福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thank you, sir. Here's some joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我来看看你做得如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's going okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.17,0:04:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  我顺便捐点钱  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good. Here, let me help you out. Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:04:59.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Wow. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新的麂皮外套  好像很贵\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that a new suede jacket? It looks really expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.39,0:05:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  不便宜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.81,0:05:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚去做指甲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just get your nails done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  菲比  我只剩这些钱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Phoebe, but this is all I have, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢啦  佳节快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, thanks. Happy holidays.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你幸福  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's your joy. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佳节快乐  等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Happy holidays and-Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.53,0:05:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只能捐钱  不能拿钱  我跟你换零钱搭公车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't take the money out. I'm making change for the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿零钱就好  其他钱是要救济穷人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can't you leave the dollar? This money's for the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是穷人  而且还得搭公车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm poor. I gotta take the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,佳节愉快  可是你不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Seasons greetings and everything. But still--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:36.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去死  小妞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bite me, blondie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除了祝他幸福  我还要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm gonna give him something besides joy. Just--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:51.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个角色根本就是为我而写的  不敢相信我竟然落选\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That part was perfect for me. I can't believe I didn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该怎么做吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what you should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要自己创造机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should make something happen for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,例如  写部电影剧本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, like write a play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像《心灵捕手》那两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Write a movie, huh? What about those Good Will Hunting guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  少作白日梦了  就算我写出剧本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Ross. Be realistic, you know? If I did write something...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.86,0:06:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪有办法请到他们来演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...what are the chances I could get those guys to star in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了  我可以自己主演  也可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a second. I could star in it! Or that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会写剧本  我的意思是  我是演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't write, you know. I mean, I'm an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没受过编剧的训练  我办不到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have the discipline that it takes, you know. I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以帮你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.76,0:06:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮你订出时间表  盯着你乖乖照做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'll make up a schedule and make sure you stick to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样我自己也有事做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus it'll give me something to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  你愿意帮我  对  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? You'd do that for me? Thanks. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始慢慢来  今晚之前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll start off slow. The only thing you have to do tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.77,0:06:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要想好主角名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is come up with the name of your main character.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  不能是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Done. And it can't be Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  也不能是约瑟夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not. Or Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你怎么啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.83,0:07:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚看到丹尼跟女生搭地铁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just saw Danny getting on the subway with a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还搂着她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and he had his arm around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  我真为你难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, honey, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.75,0:07:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的确该难过  一切都要怪你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you should be. This is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫你插手我们的感情世界\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You meddled in our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们根本没在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You had no relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:16.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我已经拟好计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, but I was doing my thing, and everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.18,0:07:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都按部就班进行中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...was going according to the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  别再提你的鸟计划了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God. Stop with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.31,0:07:25.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你看到他跟女生在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unh. So what if you saw him with a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又如何  他们不见得是情人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who cares? That doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就快跟丹尼约会了  到时你可以火力全开  迷得他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll go out on a date with Danny and be so charming he'll forget all about...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忘记地铁那个蠢妞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that stupid subway girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.78,0:07:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那女生的确傻里傻气的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was kind of stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  好  我这就去赴约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. All right. I'm just gonna go on the date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去赴约  这就是我的新计划\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just gonna go on the date. That is the new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.77,0:08:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"多疑" 怎么写  干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how do you spell "suspicious"? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这个角色很 "多疑"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I think this character is gonna be suspicious about stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.03,0:08:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德宾7分  钱德宾0分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler Bing, seven, Chandler Bing, zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看你玩那个都快让我抓狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're driving me crazy with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.29,0:08:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我不玩就是了  不  继续玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll stop. No, don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,碗拿远一点  连罗斯都投得进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Move the bowl further away. Ross could make that shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.47,0:08:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是酷死了  不过你至少进了成人组\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you suck. But at least you suck at a man's game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:38.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要玩  我不能跟你玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna play? I can't be playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯就快回来了  按照他的时间表  我今天应该写完5页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross will be home soon. I have to write five pages to stick to his schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以先玩30分钟  再继续用功到他回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, so play for the next 30 minutes, then you can write until he gets home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  规则应该\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, listen, what do you say we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更上一层楼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...crank it up a notch?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿闻其详\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要先找到可燃性液体\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. All we need is a little lighter fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  不过你小心点  我还想拿回房租订金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but be careful. I wanna get our security deposit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们发明铁鎚标枪时  就拿不回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I think we said goodbye to that when we invented hammer darts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得哪面墙壁没补过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you remember which part of the wall is not spackle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得  这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, yeah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  佳节愉快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Happy holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐  那可是垃圾  不可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's trash, young lady. No, you can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  阻止那位小姐  她竟然捐垃圾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Stop that young lady! She donated trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,捐筒着火了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The charity's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来人啊  太好了  谢谢  我正需要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help! Good, thank you. I need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:42.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么鬼东西  现在才早上9点啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is this? It's 9:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.70,0:09:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看看“场景  房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. "A room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一名男子  多疑地走进来”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A man enters. He looks suspicious."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你今天应该写5页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you were supposed to have five pages done by now...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.47,0:10:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还包括一个高潮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...including an exciting incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么垃圾  "大火球游戏规则"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is all this? "The Official Rulebook of Fireball."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  我们刚在玩这游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that's the game we played.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好玩  道具就是一颗网球  一个碗  可燃液体\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it's great. You take a tennis ball, a bowl and lighter fl--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这对你的事业有帮助吗  我还以为你想当演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is helping your career, huh? You wanted to be an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.37,0:10:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是发明危险游戏被人告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not the creator of Crazy Lawsuit Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  我该工作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right, you're right. I'll get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真不应该  还带坏他  明知道乔伊应该要工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And shame on you. You should know better. Joey needs to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,振作点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now come on. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  不行  等你写完5页才还你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, uh-uh. You can have this back when the five pages are done, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚很开心  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had a really nice time tonight. So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好摩妮卡约我们出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm really glad Monica asked us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想请你进去  不过我妹来了住我家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd love to ask you in but my sister's visiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可能睡在沙发上了  你妹妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think she's asleep on the couch. Your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.13,0:11:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妹妹睡在沙发上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your sister's asleep on the couch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我上次看到你们一起搭地铁  现在她还睡在你沙发上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, I saw you with her on the subway and now she's asleep on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就猜是你  太好了  你起床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I thought I heard you. Oh, hey, great, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  这是我妹妹克莉丝塔  克莉丝塔  这是瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, my sister Krista. Krista, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  很高兴认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该告诉我要带朋友回来  害我穿得邋里邋遢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wish you told me we were having company. I'd have fixed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有差吗  你真恶劣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like it would help. You are so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你  是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你  是你  是你  是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are. You are. You are. You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.40,0:11:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你完蛋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are so dead. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要教训你一顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna get you. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.29,0:11:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, it's very nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人  没一个人尊重募捐筒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nobody. Nobody respects the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都丢些莫名其妙的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wouldn't believe what people put in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look. Okay, does this look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,垃圾桶吗  不像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a garbage can to you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像烟灰缸吗  不像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does it look like an ashtray? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像尿桶吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does it look like a urinal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呀哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ew!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.56,0:12:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你还要回去募捐吗  当然  不过我受够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Pheebs, you gonna go back out there? Yeah, but I'm not gonna take any more crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.02,0:12:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再也不当募捐好好小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? No more Mrs. Nice Bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.36,0:12:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加油  你在街上流浪过  够强悍啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, good for you. You're tough. You lived on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:27.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要当回强悍菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm gonna go back to being Street Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  也不能全当回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Oh, but you know what? I can't go totally back...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为  强悍菲比才不会鸟你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because Street Phoebe really wouldn't be friends with you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.71,0:12:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以问个问题吗  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, can I ask you guys something? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.76,0:12:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有兄弟  实在不了解  不过你们会打来打去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Urn, I don't have any brothers so I don't know, but did you guys wrestle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然会  常常啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. All the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.47,0:12:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且  我从没输过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, I was undefeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.39,0:12:53.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你以前90多公斤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you weighed 200 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还是跟猫咪一样矫捷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Still, I was quick as a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.94,0:13:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天遇到丹尼的妹妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I met Danny's sister yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是跟他一起搭地铁的那个  真的假的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, that was the girl on the subway. Oh, you're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们非常\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they were very, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会扭打\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...wrestle-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样正常吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I guess that's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在不会这样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't wrestle now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我长大变得强壮后就不打了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not since I got too strong for you. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长大变壮  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Too strong for me? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:24.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要比划一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna go right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以立刻打败你  信不信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I'll take you right now, buddy. You wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.80,0:13:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,预备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wrestle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛  很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you know what, um?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们  帮了大忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, that's great. That helps a lot. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.45,0:13:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赶快走  20分后球赛就要开打了  乔伊  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys, come on, let's go. The puck drops in 20 minutes. Come on. Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊不能去  我还没写完5页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey's not going. I didn't finish my five pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天再写不就成了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why can't you finish them tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他明天要修改昨天的5页\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because tomorrow he's redoing yesterday's pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天写的有所改进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yesterday's pages did not reflect my best work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:10.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再逼他  让他透口气  搞不好会写得更好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you cut him a little slack? Maybe if he relaxes, he'll get some work done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.89,0:14:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经透够多气了  这都要感谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think he's been relaxing enough, thanks to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟大火球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and Fireball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩大火球可是很紧张  显然你没玩过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you think Fireball's relaxing, you obviously have never played.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.94,0:14:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拼命压榨乔伊  是因为你太无聊了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only reason you're doing this to Joey is you're bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.78,0:14:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是乔伊害你失业的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not his fault that you're unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是失业  只是进修中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not unemployed. I'm on sabbatical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.70,0:14:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  你们别吵架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, look. Guys, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.53,0:14:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我之所以这么做  是因为我是乔伊的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the reason I'm doing this is because I am Joey's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你也是他好友  就该跟我一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if you were a good friend, you'd be doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当好友就得这么混帐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So being a good friend means acting like a jerk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是真如你所说  你可真是我第一号好友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If it does, then you're an amazing friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别吵了  何不大家玩场大火球  尽弃前嫌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. How about we settle this over a friendly game of Fireball, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去拆掉防火警铃  何不现在就一了百了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll go unhook the smoke detectors. How about we settle this right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  谁也不准去看球赛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There. Now no one's going to the game. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:14:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门票是我买的  才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I paid for those tickets. No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你每次都说要付钱  却一次也没吐过钱  也对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said you would, but you never did. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们终于爬到山顶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we finally get to the top of the mountain, ahem...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果这个笨蛋竟然忘了相机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and airhead here forgets the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:18.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也发生过这种事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that same thing happened to me one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When did that happen to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记不记得  上次我们不是到公园慢跑  看到那只可爱小鸟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you remember? We were jogging in the park, we saw that pretty bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:29.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果想拍  我竟然没带相机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I wanted to take a picture but I didn't have my camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对  不过追小贩可不算慢跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. First of all, chasing the churro guy is not jogging.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超好吃  你一定要吃一口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, this is so good. You have got to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕  裤子沾到了  我来擦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, damn. I got it on my pants. Here, I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最好上楼换件裤子 否则以后洗不掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We better take these off or that stain will set.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我今晚约会还要穿  喔  真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna wear these pants on our date tonight. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  老天爷啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, bye. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议  看吧  我早说过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was unbelievable. Okay, see? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的瑞秋  我不相信他们是兄妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, wow. Sorry, Rash. I don't believe they're brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是兄妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're brother and sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.60,0:16:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（非尿桶）\N
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（我没有百货公司简介）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  手张开  让我检查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. Open your hand. Let me take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.53,0:16:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两毛五  一毛  线头不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Quarter, dime. Lint? Not interested in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  加拿大硬币  滚蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's this? A Canadian coin? Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.34,0:16:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不准在募捐筒旁边喝东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa. No drinks near the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:53.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先放在那边  才准捐款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Set it down over there and then you can make a contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.97,0:16:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,少装一副可怜兮兮的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you can leave the "hurt bunny" look over there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  鲍柏  不是叫你滚蛋了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Bob. I thought I told you to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们接到申诉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Phoebe, we've been getting complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:10.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上面要调你离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we're gonna move you to a less high-profile spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:15.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以后这里由金洁负责  这小妞才没这能耐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Ginger's gonna take over this corner. That chick can't handle my corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.95,0:17:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不走  我们就得赶你走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, either you leave or we remove you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,劝你一句  注意那个臭婆娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll give you one pointer. Look out for that bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:46.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  不是约的7点吗  我看  今天就算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, Rach. I thought we said 7. Yeah, uh, you know what? Uh, let's skip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Uh, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um... Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们兄妹似乎  非常要好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You and your sister seem to have, um, a very special bond--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  又说这句话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great. That "special bond" again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我妹感情好  又是哪里让人看不顺眼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do women have such a problem with the fact that I'm close with my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.83,0:18:05.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  我不知道事实真相  你有兄弟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, I don't know, but-Do you have brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:11.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我有两个姊姊  其中一个很像男人婆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I have two sisters, but one of them actually has a very masculine energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.46,0:18:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要好吗  不  她们不是好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you close with them? No, no. They're not very nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.38,0:18:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  过来  听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, come here. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很喜欢你  交往下去应该会有结果\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really like you, okay? I think this could go somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是跟家人感情深厚  你就为了这点拒绝我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what if I'm close to my family? You gonna let that stand in the way of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听你这么说也有道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, when you put it that way, you know--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.31,0:18:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,丹尼  快点  洗澡水快凉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Danny, hurry up. The bath's getting cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么了  我先走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Yeah, okay, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路上有小孩在玩耍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey. There's some kids playing in the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要不要去叫他们写作业  毁了他们的一天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna go down there, give them a project, ruin their day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你手边有球  就可以插上剃刀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, if they have a ball, maybe you could stick razor blades in it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教他们玩新游戏  "杀人球"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and teach them a new game: "Gonna-Need-Stitches Ball."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两位  我整个早上都待在图书馆  已经写完今天的5页了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. I was at the library all morning and I already finished my five pages for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.64,0:19:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那敢情好  我们可以去看昨晚的《骑兵队》比赛了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Now we can go to the Ranger game last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.52,0:19:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  门票被罗斯撕掉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, dude. Ross tore up the tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.19,0:19:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有让你分心的事情  就比较容易专心吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess when you don't have so many distractions, it's easier for you to focus, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人整天跟在你屁股后面  也比较得心应手吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, or also when you don't have somebody breathing down your neck all the livelong day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便你们说  总之我写完了  而且写得还不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's fine, but the important thing is I finished it. And I think it's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你们帮忙念台词  才是真正帮大忙  可不可以帮我这个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know what would help me, is if I could hear it. Would you guys read it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, all right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  "一间普通的纽约公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. "It's a typical New York City apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两个男人正在家里" 罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two guys are hanging out." Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.27,0:19:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  老兄  有什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Hey, man." "What is up?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:20:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"昨天  是我错了  对不起"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"About yesterday. I was really wrong. I am sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"是我  我才该道歉  我反应过头了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"No, it was me. I'm sorry. I overreacted."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.12,0:20:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们都有错  反正我们都是为了朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Maybe it was both of us. But we had our best friend's inter--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是为了朋友好"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we had our best friend's interest at heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我非常不好意思"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Could I be more sorry?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我不知道  我才是该道歉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I don't know. I am one sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,古生物学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...polontologist."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我们懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Joey, we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我也该道歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. I'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:43.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你们要继续读下去  精彩的才要上场  继续念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no, no. Keep reading. The good part's coming up. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"对不起  钱德"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I am sorry, Chandler."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"对不起  罗斯"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I am sorry, Ross."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帅哥上场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. "A handsome man enters."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"你们好吗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Hey. How's it going, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道你们在扯什么  不过我要向你们两位道谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what you two are talking about, but I'd just like to say thanks to both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我不放弃自己\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You. You wouldn't let me give up on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.72,0:21:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  你与我一起创造了大火球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you. Well, you co-created Fireball.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剧终\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The End." Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就花了你一整天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This took you all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.44,0:21:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我只写了5分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, this only took five minutes.
